      "grammarFocus": "future tense",
      "sentenceRef": "Я буду расти как специалист.",
      "explanation": "The imperfective future is formed with 'буду/будешь/будет...' + imperfective infinitive: 'Я буду расти' = I will grow (ongoing process). This describes continuous or repeated future actions. Compare with perfective future which uses just one word: 'Я вырасту' (I will grow up, completed). Examples: 'Я буду работать' (I will be working), 'Она будет учиться' (She will be studying).",
